port for OpenAPI, Postman, and GraphQL formats.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-14\",\n    \"category\": \"workflow agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": [\n      \"The API management platform for humans and agents\",\n      \"Docs that humans and agents ship together\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Asteroid Build\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/asteroid-build\",\n    \"description\": \"No-code platform for building AI agents that can run in browsers, Linux, and Windows environments. Enables rapid deployment of cross-platform AI agents.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-14\",\n    \"category\": \"workflow agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": [\n      \"Browser, Linux and Windows AI agents in seconds\",\n      \"No-code platform for cross-platform AI agent deployment\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Relay\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/relay\",\n    \"description\": \"Chrome extension that provides persistent context across AI interactions. Eliminates the need to repeat information to different AI tools by maintaining shared context.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-15\",\n    \"category\": \"workflow agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": [\n      \"Stop repeating yourself to every AI\",\n      \"Persistent context across AI interactions via Chrome extension\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Wring\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/wring\",\n    \"description\": \"Menu bar app that provides quick access to developer tools. One-click access from the macOS menu bar for common development utilities.\",\n    \"release_date\": \"2026-05-16\",\n    \"category\": \"workflow agent\",\n    \"sources\": [\"Product Hunt\"],\n    \"community_quotes\": [\n      \"Developer tools, one menu click away\",\n      \"Quick access to developer tools from macOS menu bar\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n